      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>I am having an issue with how a custom Link field displays data when fetched from the Customer DocType into a Sales Invoice in ERPNext v16.</p>\n<p><strong>The Setup:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Custom DocType (<code>Tax Office</code>):</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Fields: <code>vergi_dairesi</code> (Tax Office Name), <code>sehir</code> (City).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>View Settings:</strong> “Show Title in Link Fields” is checked.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Naming:</strong> Title Field is set to <code>vergi_dairesi</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>List / Search Settings :</strong> <code>In List View</code> set.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/f/9fb52536ad6a6e180957b983a3740e5297360786.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9fb52536ad6a6e180957b983a3740e5297360786\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/f/9fb52536ad6a6e180957b983a3740e5297360786_2_690x210.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"mMQ1eImnyEeaSnECh6Es5wfPxyK\" width=\"690\" height=\"210\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/f/9fb52536ad6a6e180957b983a3740e5297360786_2_690x210.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/f/9fb52536ad6a6e180957b983a3740e5297360786.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/f/9fb52536ad6a6e180957b983a3740e5297360786.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">795×243 11.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/c/fca9835868b91bd97ec53f398d37df791dd784ef.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fca9835868b91bd97ec53f398d37df791dd784ef\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/c/fca9835868b91bd97ec53f398d37df791dd784ef.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"A39va5OT4FdOxEhnas7uzcoyZdB\" width=\"664\" height=\"300\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">664×300 10.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/3/038eabc846bf57a31a5dc4076dd6a6addcba430b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/038eabc846bf57a31a5dc4076dd6a6addcba430b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/3/038eabc846bf57a31a5dc4076dd6a6addcba430b_2_690x151.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"vt6qvXtp3Y1NfSaoc4mFoKBiMH\" width=\"690\" height=\"151\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/3/038eabc846bf57a31a5dc4076dd6a6addcba430b_2_690x151.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/3/038eabc846bf57a31a5dc4076dd6a6addcba430b.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/3/038eabc846bf57a31a5dc4076dd6a6addcba430b.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">868×190 8.52 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Customize Customer DocType:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>I added a Link field pointing to the <code>Tax Office</code> DocType. This works perfectly; it shows the Name (Title) instead of the ID.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/7/07b5a534790204ce547357056dbba5c6c1738e17.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/07b5a534790204ce547357056dbba5c6c1738e17\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/7/07b5a534790204ce547357056dbba5c6c1738e17.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"16cvY38VPo97oS6giLl7nbWfdZl\" width=\"685\" height=\"265\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">685×265 8.41 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Sales Invoice DocType:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>I added a custom field <code>vergi_dairesi</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> Data (I also tried Link).</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/4/346e5ba8b12f3b0a7a50a52b30df4f571dba90b7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/346e5ba8b12f3b0a7a50a52b30df4f571dba90b7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/4/346e5ba8b12f3b0a7a50a52b30df4f571dba90b7.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"7tPgHSwEBjELkp0Mte3T95LXqJN\" width=\"370\" height=\"298\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">370×298 5.23 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Fetch From:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><code>customer</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>Tax Office (Link)</code></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/f/9f1880df0851d92622a6b314354f9371b99c9a8a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9f1880df0851d92622a6b314354f9371b99c9a8a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/f/9f1880df0851d92622a6b314354f9371b99c9a8a.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"mHqpNuqZpgyvbjhk4Mm4KQbXrhE\" width=\"382\" height=\"177\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">382×177 3.63 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>The Problem:</strong> When I select a Customer on a Sales Invoice, the field <code>vergi_dairesi</code> fetches the <strong>ID</strong> of the Tax Office record instead of the <strong>Title (vergi_dairesi)</strong>.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/1/91aa3f849b0422755d478a0f8085c0c212819112.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/91aa3f849b0422755d478a0f8085c0c212819112\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/1/91aa3f849b0422755d478a0f8085c0c212819112_2_528x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kMBZglAnBWodBvC0C4zKN5ROJ8e\" width=\"528\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/1/91aa3f849b0422755d478a0f8085c0c212819112_2_528x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/1/91aa3f849b0422755d478a0f8085c0c212819112.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/1/91aa3f849b0422755d478a0f8085c0c212819112.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">720×681 24.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Even though “Show Title in Link Fields” is active on the source DocType, the fetch command seems to ignore the display title and grabs the raw database ID.</p>\n<p><strong>Question:</strong> How can I ensure the Sales Invoice fetches the “Title” (Name of the office) or displays the Link correctly as it does on the Customer page?</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance!</p>",
