      "created_at": "2026-01-21T06:15:24.802Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I am not sure this is what you are looking for but how about this:</p>\n<p>If calling Selçuk V.D. is problem you can create a readonly title field and with a client script, script can write into it both field names like:</p>\n<p>Selçuk V.D. - İzmir<br>\nSelçuk V.D. - Konya</p>",
