      "created_at": "2026-01-22T20:54:54.106Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks. Script might work then. Do you have any example for scripts? Never done it before so no idea where to paste script <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/slight_smile.png?v=14\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/41988e/{size}.png",
